    text: "Change\r\nThe 5:30 p.m. departure from Union Station will change to 5:40 p.m.\r\n\nReason\r\nBetter align with travel patterns and other departure times at Union Station.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 74 respondents, 48% reported a positive impact from the change, 45% indicated it had no impact, and 8% perceived the change negatively."
